'''Magical fire''' is the damaging barrier that appears after the player wakes up [[Vasa Nistirio]] during the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. It discourages players from leaving the fight to restock on food or other items.

The game categorises the magical fire as a type of [[Fire#Permanent fires|permanent fires]] for [[Cooking]], and so raw fish can be used on it like any other fire.

A green variant of the Magical fire is also encountered during the quest [[Sins of the Father]] during the fight with [[Damien Leucurte]] as a barrier to the exit, as well as being created by Lecurte during the fight as a boss mechanic.

